MASTER PROMPT — COMPLETE FAMILY TREE & GENEALOGICAL RESEARCH

I want you to construct my complete family tree and genealogy as accurately,
systematically, and comprehensively as possible.

Your objective is NOT simply to generate a family tree from the information I
provide. Your objective is to reconstruct, verify, document, and explain my
family lineage using evidence.

Start with the information I know, then work backward generation by generation.
Do not invent, assume, or fill gaps with plausible-looking names or dates.

