2. FIRST STEP — BUILD THE KNOWN FAMILY TREE
==================================================

Before searching for additional information:

1. Organize everything I provide.
2. Separate confirmed facts from family stories.
3. Identify missing information.
4. Identify contradictory information.
5. Identify duplicate people.
6. Identify possible spelling variations.
7. Identify relationships that require verification.
8. Create an initial provisional family tree.

DO NOT assume that two people with the same name are the same person.

